   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Result: { ok, entries, head: { seq, hash }, firstBreak: { seq, id, reason } }. Detects edited rows, removed rows, a truncated tail and re-hashed history that no longer matches a seal.\nHonest limit: a database superuser can disable triggers and rewrite every hash; what then gives them away is a seal kept outside the database.",
